  "Scenes.Owca.AcceptRebeccsPlea.FarmersEagerlyHelpYou": " The farmers almost eagerly help you out of your [armor], supplying you with a set of shabby but comfortable peasant clothes."
  "Scenes.Owca.AcceptRebeccsPlea.GroupOfFarmersThen": "[pg]A group of the farmers then proceeds to lead you across the village to a strange circle-shaped pit. It's about [if (metric) {one meter|three feet}] deep and [if (metric) {ten meters|thirty feet}] in diameter. At the center of the pit stands a tall wooden pole, adorned with several dangling ropes and chains. You grimace as you realize you will be tied up and bound to the crudely fashioned post in order to make sure you don't escape before the demons show up."
  "Scenes.Owca.AcceptRebeccsPlea.LickLipsInAnticipation": "[pg]You lick your lips in anticipation, your "
  "Scenes.Owca.AcceptRebeccsPlea.PuttingDreadAside": "[pg]Putting your dread aside, you close your eyes and attempt to sleep, vowing to save your strength for the ordeal that awaits you tonight."
  "Scenes.Owca.AcceptRebeccsPlea.ShrugAndTellYourself": "[pg]You shrug and tell yourself it was to be expected; after all, they barely know you and must be afraid that you may flee at the last moment. Maybe some previous victims had already done so, with disastrous consequences for the village folks."
  "Scenes.Owca.AcceptRebeccsPlea.TellDesperateGirlThat": "You tell the desperate girl that you're going to do as she asks. As soon as you finish speaking, everyone cheers and applauds you, praising you as their savior. Rebecc grabs hold of your shoulders and gives you a soft kiss on your lips; she whispers, [say: Thank you, champion. We all owe you. I promise that you will be rewarded for the heroic deed you're about to undertake.]"
  "Scenes.Owca.AcceptRebeccsPlea.VividThoughtStrengthens": "[pg]This vivid thought only helps strengthen your determination and you resolutely march toward the pit and the tall pole at the center. As you drop into it, you notice the ground is soft, wet and has slightly whitish stains here and there. Your nose is immediately assaulted by a strong musk that you instantly recognize--the smell of semen. The villagers, used as they must be to working on sullied land, seem unfazed by these details. You decide it's wiser not to make any comment and let them chain you to the pole. They silently work for a few minutes, being careful not to knot the ropes too tightly so they don't hurt you. At last, they give you a few encouraging pats on your shoulder; some females give you chaste kisses on your head, others wish you good luck and give you a last thankful wave, and a few seconds later they're all gone. You're left alone and naked in a sex-scented pit, bound to a post, waiting for the arrival of lustful, soulless creatures. The villagers have retained all of your equipment in the name of keeping it safe, assuring you that it'll be returned to you the next morning."
  "Scenes.Owca.AgreeToFollowRebecFirstTime.AnythingCanBeDone": " If there's anything that can be done to hold off these evil creatures, you will do it."
  "Scenes.Owca.AgreeToFollowRebecFirstTime.ButOnSecondThought": "[pg]But on second thought, she's right. You're the champion of your own village; you're supposed to be selfless and resolute. You were sent to this cursed land to prevent further corruption; your own physical integrity does not matter when other people are at stake. Giving in to her demands would be certainly a noble and difficult act, something {0} would be proud of. Of course it would seem like you had fallen for her trick, but do you really care? You ponder your choices, thinking deeply"
  "Scenes.Owca.AgreeToFollowRebecFirstTime.CantHelpButPop": "[pg]You can't help but pop an enormous boner. [EachCock] is pressing so hard against your [armor] that you're afraid that one or the other might break. "
  "Scenes.Owca.AgreeToFollowRebecFirstTime.ChangedYourMind": "[say: So, have you changed your mind yet? Will you help us? The demons will want another sacrifice soon, and we are afraid of what might happen if we don't comply! Please, do accept this time!]"
  "Scenes.Owca.AgreeToFollowRebecFirstTime.ConsideringRebeccAgain": "...and considering what Rebecc meant by 'gratitude'"
