  "Scenes.Owca.AgreeToFollowRebecFirstTime.EyesWidenInSurprise": "[pg]Your eyes widen in surprise when you understand what she's asking of you, but after all, why not? You're the champion; you're supposed to be selfless and resolute. You were sent to this cursed land to prevent further corruption; your own physical integrity does not matter when other people are at stake. Giving in to her demands would be certainly a noble and difficult act, something {0} would be proud of. Of course it would seem like you had fallen for her trick, but do you really care? You consider your choices"
