  "Scenes.Owca.AgreeToFollowRebecFirstTime.OnSecondThoughtProspect": "[pg]On second thought, the prospect of meeting a full horde of horny, sexually-exploratory demons has appeal all on its own. Your mind wanders a bit, thinking of all the luscious things they could do with your body; oh, the feeling of a half-dozen cocks and pussies working your every hole and pumping fluids in and out of you... perhaps you could even take a dominant position and fuck the demons until they pass out."
