  "Scenes.Owca.AgreeToFollowRebecFirstTime.ShockedByThisRevelation": "[pg]You are shocked by this revelation. You wrap your arms around Rebecc's shoulders protectively, and tell her in a reassuring tone that "
  "Scenes.Owca.AgreeToFollowRebecFirstTime.SoThisIsIt": "[pg]So this is what it has come to. Her playfulness, her enticing gestures, her seductive play... she had been planning it all along. She must have put on the same act for many people before you. You feel slightly angry at yourself for having been fooled that easily; you feel angrier at her because she tried to use you as a mere disposable victim to be toyed with and manipulated; but you feel angriest at these demons for forcing honest folks to resort to infamous practices and deceptive seduction so they can live their lives as usual."
  "Scenes.Owca.AgreeToFollowRebecFirstTime.ThereWeveAlmostArrived": "[pg][saystart]There, we've almost arrived at Owca, our village; you can see the first houses. As for demons... well, you know, they are the reason we wanted you to follow us. You see, a large group of them have been harassing us. At first they were just scavenging for food and various supplies, but soon they started claiming... another kind of prize. You know these creatures, you know what they do. There have been many battles to protect our rightful clay and hard-earned food, but there were simply too many of them. Besides, they often use some kind of... black magic in order to subdue their foes and turn them into obedient slaves. "
  "Scenes.Owca.AgreeToFollowRebecFirstTime.TheyAbusedUsMistreated": "Th-they abused us. They mistreated us. They would gather in circles and... use us in every possible way."
  "Scenes.Owca.AgreeToFollowRebecFirstTime.ThisIsItAgain": "[pg]So this is what it has come to. Her playfulness, her enticing gestures, her seductive acting... she had been planning it all along. She was doing it all on purpose, teasing you and tricking you into accepting her offer. She must have put on the same act for many people before you. You feel slightly angry at yourself for having been fooled that easily; you feel angrier at her because she tried to use you as a mere disposable victim to be toyed with and manipulated. Well, if it comes down to that, you could probably agree and either beat the demons to take their place, or help them 'renegotiate' with the villagers..."
  "Scenes.Owca.AgreeToFollowRebecFirstTime.UncontrollablyTurnedOn": "You are uncontrollably turned on by this revelation; your genitals actually hurt at your absurd level of arousal. Just imagining groups of demons gathered around the helpless villagers, sometimes taking turns with each one and sometimes taking someone all at once, turns you on way more than it should. You stupidly grin for a few seconds as your mind pictures vivid and lecherous scenes of collective ass-rape, but then you remember this is supposed to be bad news; you quickly recompose yourself and put on a false expression of worry. Luckily she didn't notice the lust that temporarily filled your eyes; neither does she spot the massive tent growing in your [armor]. You ask her if there's anything you can do to meet these demons and 'handle' them on your own."
  "Scenes.Owca.AgreeToFollowRebecFirstTime.VillageManMetDemons": "[pg][say: Well, a man from our village decided to go meet these demons at their camp in order to negotiate with them. They agreed to a deal. As you may guess, it was a... special kind of deal.]"
  "Scenes.Owca.AgreeToFollowRebecFirstTime.VillageNoAnalVirgins": "I-I don't think there's a single grown man or woman in our village that still has their anal virginity."
  "Scenes.Owca.AgreeToFollowRebecFirstTime.WaversForAMoment": "[pg][say: At the end of every week, one of us must be chained and left at the demons' disposal for the full night. It must be someone different every night. Chosen people usually come back battered and sore, and they have dirty fluids and unthinkable mixtures leaking from every hole of their body. It's a difficult thing to think about, but it's necessary for our community. But then...] She wavers for a moment, before looking back to you with a desperate plea in her eyes. [say: You're a brave, courageous adventurer; you just said you were willing to handle these demons! It would almost be a blessing to us if you could help--not that you have to, but... it seems like we're beyond saving.] The girl looks despondent, but then changes her composure when she turns back to the village. [say: I might be being selfish, but you'd have my eternal gratitude if you helped.]"
  "Scenes.Owca.BeatUpOwca.LastVillagerDrops": "The last of the villagers drops his improvised weapon. They are all lying defenseless before you. At last, you notice Rebecc, the only one still conscious, curled up as she weeps uncontrollably. She is clearly oblivious of her surroundings, undoubtedly shocked by the violent fight. Even if she calls herself your friend, you don't think you'd be able to reason with her after pummeling her kin. What do you do?"
  "Scenes.Owca.BuyOwcaShit.BartenderHandsBottle": "The bartender hands you a bottle and grabs your gems before attending other clients, leaving you to your own business.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Owca.DeclineRebeccsPlea.CantGiveInTo": "You can't give in to her demand; you are a proud warrior fighting demons. You were certainly not meant to serve as a scapegoat or sex-toy. She sighs in disappointment. [say: Well, I should have expected that. I wasn't full of hope either. No hard feelings.] Everyone is looking at you with sad or apathetically hostile eyes, making you feel uncomfortable. You quickly leave the village and return to your camp."
  "Scenes.Owca.DeclineRebeccsPlea.VillagersGrowingImpatient": "[pg]The villagers are growing impatient of your repeated refusals; you can hear them exchange hushed whispers as you depart. Failing to grant their request again will probably anger them considerably."
  "Scenes.Owca.DefeetVapulasHorde.DoYouTakeAdvantage": "[pg]Do you take advantage of them?"
  "Scenes.Owca.DefeetVapulasHorde.GrinAsDemonsAgain": "You grin wickedly as the demons give up the fight, too turned on to care about you. One even has hopeful desperation glinting in her eyes as she attempts to entice you with her long, thick nipples and enormous, dripping gash."
  "Scenes.Owca.DefeetVapulasHorde.GrinAsLastAgain": "You grin wickedly as the last demons fall, defeated."
  "Scenes.Owca.DefeetVapulasHorde.GrinWickedlyAsDemons": "You grin wickedly as the demons give up the fight, too turned on to care about you. One even begins unfastening your bindings, hopeful desperation glinting in her eyes as she attempts to entice you with her long, thick nipples and enormous, dripping gash."
  "Scenes.Owca.DefeetVapulasHorde.GrinWickedlyAsLast": "You grin wickedly as the last demons fall, defeated. Some of the errant blows have broken and mangled the links of your chains, and you find you can get free with a bit of additional effort."
  "Scenes.Owca.DefeetVapulasHorde.ThoughTheDisplay": "[pg]Though the display as they explore each other is somewhat arousing, you can't really get into it as you are, and simply use your new-found freedom to climb out of the hole. It's too dark to return to the village now, so you head back to camp."
  "Scenes.Owca.DesperateVillages.AsYouApproachGroup": "As you approach the group of huts, you hear a vague rumble, as if many people were talking at the same time. Walking closer, you see all the villagers gathering outside and arguing violently; among them you spot your friend, Rebecc. As soon as she sees you she hurries over with desperate, wet eyes."
  "Scenes.Owca.DesperateVillages.DoYouSubmit": "[pg]Do you submit?"
  "Scenes.Owca.DesperateVillages.PutYouBackPit": "[pg][say: They want to put you back into the pit by force! I and some others have tried arguing with them but they won't hear anything! The demons have been harassing us a lot due to the lack of sacrifices, please do something!]"
  "Scenes.Owca.DesperateVillages.RudelyPushedAside": "[pg]She is rudely pushed aside by a tall muscular man with a pitchfork in his hand. He starts talking in a slow, harsh voice. [say: You supposed to be brave. Go ahead. Make sacrifice. Or do we need to make you brave, be it against your own will?]"
  "Scenes.Owca.DesperateVillages.SeemsTheseVillagersHave": "[pg]It seems that these villagers have grown weary of your repeated refusals; they are likely to react angrily if you deny them another sacrifice."
  "Scenes.Owca.DisbandHorde.BegoneAllOfYou": "[pg][say: Begone. Leave, all of you. Out of my sight.]"
  "Scenes.Owca.DisbandHorde.EyesProgressivelyFilling": "[pg]Her eyes are progressively filling with fear as you deliver your ultimatum, conscious of finding someone with more power than her. She squirms uncomfortably in your grasp and nods feebly."
  "Scenes.Owca.DisbandHorde.GiveWantonSuccubusA": "[pg]You give the wanton succubus a loud slap for good measure and discard her."
  "Scenes.Owca.DisbandHorde.NodsAgainInAcknowledgement": "[pg]She nods again in acknowledgement and starts shaking her pets out of their torpor. The imps quickly awaken each other, giving you a few frightened glances every now and then. Then, a bit pathetically, Vapula gives the retreat signal. In no time the once-proud bunch disappears, probably gone for good. Hopefully, the demons have learned from their mistakes and won't bother the village again."
  "Scenes.Owca.DisbandHorde.StartSpeakingInCalm": "You start speaking in a calm, measured voice. [say: Here we are again. I cannot count how often we've been in this same situation: you struggling before me, powerless. How often do you need to be reminded your place? Back off. We don't want your kind here. Go find some other prey; fuck each other for all I care. Just stop bothering us. If I see you or your minions hanging around this village again, you will regret it. All of you.]"
  "Scenes.Owca.EndHerNow.FlailingHandsBeat": "[pg]Her flailing hands beat against you, but you hold her there firmly as her life drains away. The fear and panic in her eyes slowly fade as she starts to lose consciousness, until they're nothing more than glassy marbles. At last, as her few final twitches cease, she passes on. Now that she's finally still, her placid features look almost peaceful. Her face gives no evidence of the struggle that just occurred, but the dark red stains on her dress leave little to the imagination."
  "Scenes.Owca.EndHerNow.NowIsTheTime": "Now is the time, you can't wait a single second longer. Shifting your grip, you quickly lower the blade with deadly intent. Rebecc's eyes flash wide as she realizes what's coming, and her mouth starts to open, but it's too late. The dagger sinks into her neck, and whatever she was going to say comes out as a weak gurgle, her lifeblood spurting out through the wound and dirtying her dress."
  "Scenes.Owca.EndHerNow.OwcaHasBeenRemoved": "[pg]<b>Owca has been removed from the places menu.</b>"
  "Scenes.Owca.EndHerNow.ReleaseYourGrip": "[pg]You release your grip on the cooling corpse. Rebecc now looks for all the world like a broken doll, her youthful beauty eternally preserved in the instant of her death. You smile to yourself, your mind finally at peace. The sheep-girl might not have had the worst life, but you've now given the gift of eternity."
  "Scenes.Owca.EndHerNow.ShesPerfectLikeThis": "[pg]She's perfect like this, forever frozen in the moment you shared. You simply sit there for a while, watching her. You want to burn this image into your memory, lest you forget this feeling. Eventually, a cool breeze blows against your [skinfurscales], causing you to shiver. It's time for you to go, and so you set off through the tall grass, back to a world that will never understand what you've done here. You briefly reflect on what you're leaving behind. What will happen to the body? Will somebody discover it? No matter, there's nothing linking you back to this scene, and no one can ever take this away from you."
  "Scenes.Owca.EnjoyHerBody.AfterSpentAgain": "[pg]After you're spent, you stay like this for some time, intertwined with the slowly cooling corpse. When strength finally returns to your limbs, you slump back, exhausted."
  "Scenes.Owca.EnjoyHerBody.AfterYoureSpent": "[pg]After you're spent, you stay like this for some time, intertwined with the slowly cooling corpse. When strength finally returns to your limbs, you slump back, exhausted."
  "Scenes.Owca.EnjoyHerBody.BladeIsntSharpEnough": "[pg]The blade isn't sharp enough to cut her properly, but this has its own charm. Rebecc shrieks as you slowly, tenderly get to work on her. The dull dagger slices through her skin at an excruciatingly glacial speed, requiring a good amount of sawing and carving to get anywhere. In your passion, the first few cuts are indiscriminately spread according to your fancy, but after you've gotten the initial rush out of your system, you pace yourself, choosing your targets more selectively. It's not long before the sheep-girl's throat is raw from screaming. When you finally sit back up, panting with both effort and excitement, Rebecc's body is a patchwork of nicks and slashes."
  "Scenes.Owca.EnjoyHerBody.BothVoicesRingOut": "[pg]Both of your voices ring out when you enter her. It's her loudest scream by far, but no one is coming. She's all yours. Her unwilling cunt contracts around you, making it difficult to push in further, but you do so all the same. You let out a groan as {0} of blood flowing from her. A weak hand pushes against your chest, but none of the resistance she puts up could hope to stop a lowly imp, let alone you."
  "Scenes.Owca.EnjoyHerBody.BrandishTheDullKnife": "[pg]You brandish the dull knife in your hand, running the edge almost teasingly along an imaginary line over her pubis, before gripping it tightly and ramming it into her most delicate flesh, all in one fell swoop. Her voice rings out when the blade enters her--her loudest scream by far, but no one is coming. She's all yours. A fresh, warm flood of blood flowing from her confirms you were more than a little sloppy. No matter, this only makes your treat even more delectable. The squirming sheep tries to shift away, but it's a trivial thing to pull her back into position, intertwining your legs."
  "Scenes.Owca.EnjoyHerBody.EndIsComing": "[pg]The end is coming--yours and hers. Which will be first? Which would be better? The uncertainty is so thrilling. You're too excited, it's going too quick now, but you can't stop yourself. As the heady pleasure of taking the sheep-girl fills your mind, only a few things still register. The feeling of her soft, feeble body beneath you. The light fading in her eyes, the fire burning in yours. The blood pounding through your veins, the blood pumping out of hers. The sonorous melody of your voices merging into one harmonious concord of predator and prey, drowning out the slapping of flesh against bruised flesh."
  "Scenes.Owca.EnjoyHerBody.EndIsComingAgain": "[pg]The end is coming--yours and hers. Which will be first? Which would be better? The uncertainty is so thrilling. You're too excited, it's going too quick now, but you can't stop yourself. As the heady pleasure of taking the sheep-girl so viciously fills your mind, only a few things still register. The feeling of her soft, feeble body beneath you. The light fading in her eyes, the fire burning in yours. The blood pounding through your veins, the blood pumping out of hers. The sonorous melody of your voices merging into one harmonious concord of predator and prey, drowning out the wet slapping of flesh against bruised, bloodied flesh."
  "Scenes.Owca.EnjoyHerBody.ExtractEveryBit": "You plan to extract every bit of enjoyment from this you can, aware that you shouldn't waste a single second, so you move the knife up to the top of her worn dress and start to cut it down the middle, with some difficulty due to the dullness. Rebecc gives out great heaving sobs as you expose her body to the chilly air, moving her arms up to cover herself in shame. You push them away and admire your prize. She's truly delicious, and it feels almost decadent that you have her all to yourself. She manages to get out a single [say: S-Stop...] through all of the blubbering, but you have no intentions to. Unable to hold back any longer, you dig in."
  "Scenes.Owca.EnjoyHerBody.GrindingHandsRoam": "[pg]As you set in and start grinding, your hands roam over your claim, probing at her tender breasts, provoking weak flinches whenever you brush against a stray cut. Rebecc is crying nonstop now, but hardly makes any noise, her body having gone completely limp. It seems that she's finally surrendered to you, and this thought drives you wild. You mercilessly pound into her, repeatedly impaling yourself on the dagger's handle and her already battered body on the blade in turn, the rough treatment exacerbating the wounds from earlier and deepening the fresh gash. It's not long before not only your nethers, but the rest of your body is coated in her blood as well. You suddenly realize just how much she's losing."
  "Scenes.Owca.EnjoyHerBody.HandsRoamOverClaim": "[pg]As you set in, your hands roam over your claim, probing at her tender breasts, provoking a flinch when you brush against a stray cut. Rebecc is crying nonstop now, but hardly makes any noise, her body having gone completely limp. It seems that she's finally accepted you, and this thought drives you wild. You mercilessly pound into her, repeatedly smashing into her already battered body. This rough treatment exacerbates the wounds from earlier, and it's not long before you're coated in her blood. You suddenly realize just how much she's losing."
  "Scenes.Owca.EnjoyHerBody.MiraculouslyAgain": "[pg]And somehow, almost miraculously, you reach the end together. Just as you crest your limit, the spark in her eyes flares and then expires as her life fades away. As your trembling hips mash into Rebecc's lifeless husk, you bite down on her shoulder and squeeze her tight against you, riding the broken doll as hard as you can. Despite the fact that nothing would ever come from this union, your walls do their best to milk the blood-soaked knife buried deep inside Rebecc, squeezing it relentlessly as your mind is lost to pleasure. You almost can't believe that this ecstasy is something you get to experience, and as you hug the lifeless sheep close, you feel a deep and fulfilling gratitude towards her."
  "Scenes.Owca.EnjoyHerBody.MiraculouslyYouReach": "[pg]And somehow, almost miraculously, you reach the end together. Just as you crest your limit, the spark in her eyes flares and then expires as her life fades away. As your spurting member pumps into Rebecc's lifeless husk, you bite down on her shoulder and squeeze her tight against you, ramming into the broken doll as deep as you can. Despite the fact that nothing will come from this union, your cock does its best to fill Rebecc to the brim, firing shot after shot as your mind is lost to pleasure. You almost can't believe that this ecstasy is something you get to experience, and as you hug the lifeless sheep close, you feel a deep and fulfilling gratitude towards her."
