  "Scenes.Owca.EnjoyHerBody.RavenousWolfishGrin": "[pg]With a ravenous, wolfish grin on your face, you align your impatient hips with the dagger and press the tip of its handle against your own drooling entrance. You feel a shiver running gloriously through you as the shoddy hilt sinks inside until her bleeding pelvis is pressed firmly to yours. A weak hand pushes against your chest, but none of the resistance she puts up could hope to stop a lowly imp, let alone you."
  "Scenes.Owca.EnjoyHerBody.ShesPerfectForever": "[pg]She's perfect like this, forever frozen in the moment you shared. You simply sit there for a while, watching her. You want to burn this image into your memory, lest you forget this feeling. Eventually, a cool breeze blows against your [skinfurscales], causing you to shiver. It's time for you to go, and so you don your [armor] once again and set off through the tall grass, back to a world that will never understand what you've done here. You briefly reflect on what you're leaving behind. What will happen to the body? Will somebody discover it? No matter, there's nothing linking you back to this scene, and no one can ever take this away from you."
  "Scenes.Owca.EnslaveVapulaAsACuntWielder.ButImA": "[pg][say: Ch-champion, I want nothing more than to please you, I want to lick every [if (metric) {bit|inch}] of you, but... I'm a succubus. I need manjuice to live and you don't... you know... have the right equipment.] She giggles nervously. [say: If you let me bring my servants, or if you have other toys I could milk, then...] She trails off as she catches your expression."
  "Scenes.Owca.EnslaveVapulaAsACuntWielder.LaughInDerision": "[pg]You laugh at her in derision. [say: At least you have the merit to acknowledge you're nothing more than a cock-hungry slut. It would be a shame to waste such a body, you know. You're going to be my slut! It wouldn't change much from your ordinary life as a sex-horny bitch. It's that or Lethice.]"
  "Scenes.Owca.EnslaveVapulaAsACuntWielder.LeaveHerHanging": "[pg]You leave her hanging for a moment, then give her a curt nod. [say: Go, then. Don't forget who owns you now, slut. If you betray my confidence in you, I will hunt you down and make you wish I gave you in to Lethice.]"
